{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>美國性感女神Sydney Sweeney去年推出的自家內衣品牌一直深受女士們的歡迎，而擁有魔鬼身材的Sydney最近公開為品牌拍攝的「萬聖節」主題內衣廣告，繼續大送「秋」波！</p><p>Sydney於廣告中繼續大玩多個造型，首先扮「宅女」於家中食雪糕睇電視，之後就化身《聖誕怪傑》（How the Grinch Stole Christmas）電影中的可愛小女孩Cindy Lou Who ，最後她化身成。</p><p>「萬聖節」動畫電影角色「怪誕屍新娘」，性感得嚟亦相當搞鬼。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T16:02:33.979737+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":236,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T01:08:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T05:38:06.571130+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:58:07.500781+00:00","content_hash":"619e0a6e7466a44507460f896f42ef3381f3ea23b7e700bfbee1fa7f22cb6561","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T16:02:33.979737+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}